Define an entity called Player:
  Set x to 400.
  Set y to 300.
  Set hp to 100.

Define an entity called Bullet:
  Set x to 0.
  Set y to 0.
  Set dx to 0.
  Set dy to 0.
  Set active to 0.

Define an entity called Enemy:
  Set x to 100.
  Set y to 100.
  Set active to 1.

Define behavior move_right for Player taking speed:
  Set x of self to (x of self + speed).
  If (x of self > 800):
    Set x of self to 800.

Define behavior move_left for Player taking speed:
  Set x of self to (x of self - speed).
  If (x of self < 0):
    Set x of self to 0.

Define behavior move_up for Player taking speed:
  Set y of self to (y of self - speed).
  If (y of self < 0):
    Set y of self to 0.

Define behavior move_down for Player taking speed:
  Set y of self to (y of self + speed).
  If (y of self > 600):
    Set y of self to 600.

Create Player called hero.
Create Bullet called shot.
Create Enemy called alien1.
Create Enemy called alien2.

Set score to 0.
Set game_over to 0.
Set facing_x to 0.
Set facing_y to (0 - 1).

Please open a window with width 800 and height 600 titled "Syl Endless Alien Shooter".

Repeat while the window is not closing:
    Begin drawing.
    Clear the background to "black".

    If game_over is 0:
        Note: Handle input and move hero
        If w key is pressed:
            Trigger move_up on hero taking 5.
            Set facing_x to 0.
            Set facing_y to (0 - 1).
        If s key is pressed:
            Trigger move_down on hero taking 5.
            Set facing_x to 0.
            Set facing_y to 1.
        If a key is pressed:
            Trigger move_left on hero taking 5.
            Set facing_x to (0 - 1).
            Set facing_y to 0.
        If d key is pressed:
            Trigger move_right on hero taking 5.
            Set facing_x to 1.
            Set facing_y to 0.

        Note: Shoot bullet
        If space key is pressed:
            If (active of shot == 0):
                Set active of shot to 1.
                Set x of shot to (x of hero).
                Set y of shot to (y of hero).
                Set dx of shot to (facing_x * 12).
                Set dy of shot to (facing_y * 12).

        Note: Update bullet
        If (active of shot == 1):
            Set x of shot to (x of shot + dx of shot).
            Set y of shot to (y of shot + dy of shot).
            If (x of shot < 0) or (x of shot > 800) or (y of shot < 0) or (y of shot > 600):
                Set active of shot to 0.

        Note: Update alien1 tracking player
        If (active of alien1 == 1):
            If (x of alien1 < x of hero):
                Set x of alien1 to (x of alien1 + 2).
            If (x of alien1 > x of hero):
                Set x of alien1 to (x of alien1 - 2).
            If (y of alien1 < y of hero):
                Set y of alien1 to (y of alien1 + 2).
            If (y of alien1 > y of hero):
                Set y of alien1 to (y of alien1 - 2).

        Note: Update alien2 tracking player
        If (active of alien2 == 1):
            If (x of alien2 < x of hero):
                Set x of alien2 to (x of alien2 + 2).
            If (x of alien2 > x of hero):
                Set x of alien2 to (x of alien2 - 2).
            If (y of alien2 < y of hero):
                Set y of alien2 to (y of alien2 + 2).
            If (y of alien2 > y of hero):
                Set y of alien2 to (y of alien2 - 2).

        Note: Bullet & Enemy1 collision
        If (active of shot == 1) and (active of alien1 == 1):
            Set diff1_x to (x of shot - x of alien1).
            Set diff1_y to (y of shot - y of alien1).
            If (diff1_x < 0):
                Set diff1_x to (0 - diff1_x).
            If (diff1_y < 0):
                Set diff1_y to (0 - diff1_y).
            If (diff1_x < 25) and (diff1_y < 25):
                Set active of alien1 to 0.
                Set active of shot to 0.
                Set score to (score + 10).

        Note: Bullet & Enemy2 collision
        If (active of shot == 1) and (active of alien2 == 1):
            Set diff2_x to (x of shot - x of alien2).
            Set diff2_y to (y of shot - y of alien2).
            If (diff2_x < 0):
                Set diff2_x to (0 - diff2_x).
            If (diff2_y < 0):
                Set diff2_y to (0 - diff2_y).
            If (diff2_x < 25) and (diff2_y < 25):
                Set active of alien2 to 0.
                Set active of shot to 0.
                Set score to (score + 10).

        Note: Respawn enemies if dead
        If (active of alien1 == 0):
            Set x of alien1 to a random number between 50 and 750.
            Set y of alien1 to a random number between 50 and 150.
            Set active of alien1 to 1.
        If (active of alien2 == 0):
            Set x of alien2 to a random number between 50 and 750.
            Set y of alien2 to a random number between 450 and 550.
            Set active of alien2 to 1.

        Note: Enemy1 & Player collision
        If (active of alien1 == 1):
            Set p_diff1_x to (x of hero - x of alien1).
            Set p_diff1_y to (y of hero - y of alien1).
            If (p_diff1_x < 0):
                Set p_diff1_x to (0 - p_diff1_x).
            If (p_diff1_y < 0):
                Set p_diff1_y to (0 - p_diff1_y).
            If (p_diff1_x < 30) and (p_diff1_y < 30):
                Set hp of hero to (hp of hero - 2).
                If (hp of hero < 1):
                    Set game_over to 1.

        Note: Enemy2 & Player collision
        If (active of alien2 == 1):
            Set p_diff2_x to (x of hero - x of alien2).
            Set p_diff2_y to (y of hero - y of alien2).
            If (p_diff2_x < 0):
                Set p_diff2_x to (0 - p_diff2_x).
            If (p_diff2_y < 0):
                Set p_diff2_y to (0 - p_diff2_y).
            If (p_diff2_x < 30) and (p_diff2_y < 30):
                Set hp of hero to (hp of hero - 2).
                If (hp of hero < 1):
                    Set game_over to 1.

        Note: Draw gameplay
        Draw circle at (x of hero), (y of hero) with radius 20 colored "green".
        
        If (active of shot == 1):
            Draw circle at (x of shot), (y of shot) with radius 6 colored "yellow".
            
        If (active of alien1 == 1):
            Draw circle at (x of alien1), (y of alien1) with radius 15 colored "red".
            
        If (active of alien2 == 1):
            Draw circle at (x of alien2), (y of alien2) with radius 15 colored "red".

        Draw text "SCORE: " joined with score at position 20, 20.
        Draw text "HP: " joined with (hp of hero) at position 20, 50.
        Draw text "Move with W/A/S/D - Shoot with SPACE" at position 20, 560.

    If game_over is 1:
        Draw text "GAME OVER" at position 300, 250.
        Draw text "Final Score: " joined with score at position 300, 300.
        Draw text "Press R to Restart" at position 300, 350.
        If r key is pressed:
            Set game_over to 0.
            Set score to 0.
            Set hp of hero to 100.
            Set x of hero to 400.
            Set y of hero to 300.
            Set active of alien1 to 0.
            Set active of alien2 to 0.
            Set active of shot to 0.

    End drawing.
